      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 1</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai27/renshuuC-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px;\"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000100010.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">あのう、こちらで ①<u><ruby>料理<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>教室<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>開<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け</u>ますか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Xin lỗi, ở đây có mở lớp nấu ăn không vậy?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">ええ。3<ruby>階<rp>(</rp><rt>かい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に ②<u>キッチン</u>が あります。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Có đấy. Nhà bếp nằm trên tầng 3.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">③<u><ruby>道具<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も <ruby>借<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りられ</u>ますか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Có thể mượn dụng cụ không vậy?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">ええ、③<u><ruby>借<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りられ</u>ます。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Được chứ, có thể mượn được.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai27_rsc1_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> ① パーティーを します</p> <p> ② パーティールーム</p> <p> ③ カラオケも <ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>います</p> <p> <span>2)</span><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai27_rsc1_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> ① <ruby>会議室<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>借<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります</p> <p> ② <ruby>会議室<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p> <p> ③ コピーも します</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 2</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai27/renshuuC-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000100011.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>皆<rp>(</rp><rt>みな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さん、これを <ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て ください。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Mọi người hãy nhìn cái này.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">あのう、①<u>うしろまで <ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こえない</u>んですが…。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Bạn ơi, phía sau không nghe được.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">すみませんが、<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>ほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、②<u>もう <ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し <ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て</u> ください。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Xin lỗi. Những người phía trước, đến phía trước thêm một chút.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">・・・・・①<u><ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こえ</u>ますか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Có nghe thấy không?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">はい、①<u><ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こえ</u>ます。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vâng, nghe thấy rồi ạ.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai27_rsc2_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> ① <ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えせん</p> <p> ② <ruby>座<rp>(</rp><rt>すわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります</p> <p> <span>2)</span><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai27_rsc2_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> ① <ruby>説明<rp>(</rp><rt>せつめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こえません</p> <p> ② <ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を やめます</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 3</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai27/renshuuC-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000100100.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">①<u>これ</u>、お<ruby>願<rp>(</rp><rt>ねが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いします。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Cái này, xin nhờ anh.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">はい。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vâng.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">どのくらい かかりますか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div cla